cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to AortaAI Colombia, please cite the IOCIM 2026 contribution below."
title: "AortaAI Colombia: Automated CTA Pipeline for Thoracic Aortic Aneurysm Risk Stratification"
abstract: >
  Automated pipeline for thoracic aortic aneurysm risk stratification from CT
  angiography, validated on 43 studies from Colombian patients (MAE 2.48 mm,
  r = 0.957). This repository is a public showcase; the source code is private.
type: software
